  "learningObjectives": [
    "Explain how a concept graph represents a course as concept nodes joined by directed prerequisite edges",
    "Distinguish foundational concepts, which have no incoming prerequisite edges, from advanced concepts that depend on many others",
    "Trace a dependency path through the graph to determine a valid teaching order for a set of concepts",
    "Compare a force-directed layout with the fixed-position layout for readability of the same concept graph",
    "Design a prompt that elicits a non-duplicated, dependency-ordered concept list for a course"
